      "content": "surrender to letting it fall apart... it just sounds so lonely. i feel like i'm just stuck in this middle ground where i'm not even alive, i'm just... existing. like i'm just a shadow left behind while he's actually gone. do you think it's even possible to be a \"person\" again when the other half is just... gone?",
